/Alt (The three-panel figure shows model performance. Panel a presents four 3D bar graphs. The first bar graph shows R squared values, the second shows MAE, the third shows MSE, and the fourth shows RMSE. Each bar graph displays values for OLS, RF, LightGBM, and XGBoost models across years 2012, 2016, 2020, and 2023. Panel b contains four heatmaps, one for each model: OLS, RF, LightGBM, and XGBoost. Each heatmap shows R squared, RMSE, MAE, and AUC values for years 2012, 2016, 2020, 2023, and an average. Panel c displays four ROC curves, one for each year: 2012, 2016, 2020, and 2023. Each ROC curve plots TPR on the vertical axis against FPR on the horizontal axis, showing performance for Random Forest, XGBoost, LightGBM, and OLS models, with AUC values listed in the legend. All ROC curves show a sharp increase in TPR as FPR increases from 0 to 0.2, then plateau near 1.0 TPR.)
